      "id": "probability-l06-q01",
      "version": 1,
      "prompt": "平均μ、分散σ²>0の正規分布N(μ,σ²)の確率密度関数は？",
      "answer": "\\(f(x)=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma^2}}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\dfrac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)\\)、\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)。",
      "criterion": "正規化係数と、指数の分母2σ²・負号が正しければ正解。",
      "explanation": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "normal.png",
          "page": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "probability-l06-q02",
      "version": 1,
      "prompt": "\\(X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\)、σ>0とする。標準正規分布N(0,1)に従う変数ZをXからどう作る？",
      "answer": "\\(Z=(X-\\mu)/\\sigma\\)。",
      "criterion": "平均を引き、分散ではなく標準偏差σで割れば正解。",
      "explanation": "",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "normal.png",
          "page": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "probability-l06-q03",
      "version": 1,
      "prompt": "\\(X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\)のとき、E[X]とV(X)は？",
      "answer": "\\(E[X]=\\mu\\)、\\(V(X)=\\sigma^2\\)。",
      "criterion": "第2パラメータが標準偏差ではなく分散と言えれば正解。",
      "explanation": "",
